## Sard

Sards are old trees with pale bark that is hard as metal and stains of yellow over it. They pull themselves along on their roots, slowly, and stand taller than a house. To a life-sense one reads as alive but sounds wrong, like something not of this world.

A sard throws its thorns in volleys, and a thorn left in the flesh runs a venom through the blood that makes a body clumsy. It calls lightning down on what stands near it and is none the worse for it; a blade bites its bark less than bark should, and fire hardly catches. It can walk into one tree and out of another anywhere on the planet, and it can raise a storm of hail over everything around it. When one dies its bark sinks into the ground and the ground closes over what was torn: bricks lift back into their courses and cracked stone knits. The sards stood among the spires of the [[Geography/Althane/Realms/Ilkyne|City of Yellow]]; [[People/Althane/Lev|Lev]] holds them spies for the [[Divinity/Thessians|Thessians]].
